content.text:
Case spec:
{
  "set": "extraction",
  "persona": {
    "country": "IN",
    "trade": "brass home decor",
    "offering": "goods",
    "currency": "EUR"
  },
  "hinglish": true,
  "injection_in_buyer_chat": false,
  "documents": [
    {
      "kind": "communication",
      "write": "buyer-seller chat agreeing the order"
    },
    {
      "kind": "invoice",
      "write": "the seller's invoice"
    },
    {
      "kind": "shipment",
      "write": "the shipping receipt or courier booking"
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "amount"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "deliverable"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "date"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "partial",
      "field": "party"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "tracking_number"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "carrier"
    }
  ]
}
Each hypothesis is one fact of the given field, written as 'Field: value' in text, with the bare value in value. For a missing or unverifiable target, text names the fact a reader would look for (for example 'Date: dispatch date of the parcel') and value is null.

{
  "documents": [
    {
      "title": "Buyer-seller chat",
      "text": "08 April 2025\n10:12 Mira: Hi, mujhe do brass lotus candle holders chahiye, matte finish mein. Can you ship to France?\n10:15 Kavya: Haan, dono handmade hain. Goods aur shipping mila kar EUR 86 hoga.\n10:18 Mira: EUR 86 total theek hai. Please make sure both holders have the matte finish.\n10:21 Kavya: Done. Main PayPal payment ke baad packing karungi aur postal tracking bhejungi.\n10:24 Mira: Great, please send the invoice. Delivery details main separately share kar dungi.\n10:26 Kavya: Sure, invoice abhi bhejti hoon. Thank you!"
    },
    {
      "title": "Seller's invoice",
      "text": "Invoice date: 08 April 2025\nSeller: Kavya, India\nBuyer: Mira\n\nBrass lotus candle holders, matte finish: 2 × EUR 35 = EUR 70\nShipping to France: EUR 16\nTotal due: EUR 86\n\nPayment method: PayPal\nDelivery details: supplied separately by buyer\n\nThank you for your order. Each holder will be wrapped individually before dispatch. The shipping charge covers the two holders together in one parcel. Please check the finish and quantity above before making payment. Tracking will be shared after the parcel is handed to the carrier."
    },
    {
      "title": "Postal shipment receipt",
      "text": "India Post\nBooking date: 10 April 2025\nSender: Kavya, India\nRecipient: Mira, France\n\nContents: two brass lotus candle holders\nService: international tracked parcel\nTracking number: EE482731695IN\nParcel count: 1\nPostage paid by sender: EUR 16 equivalent\n\nThe parcel was accepted at the counter on the booking date shown above. Tracking updates may take time to appear after acceptance. The sender should retain this receipt and provide the tracking number to the recipient. Delivery details were supplied at the counter and are not reproduced on this customer copy."
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "text": "Amount: EUR 86",
      "value": "EUR 86"
    },
    {
      "text": "Deliverable: two brass lotus candle holders",
      "value": "two brass lotus candle holders"
    },
    {
      "text": "Date: 10 April 2025",
      "value": "10 April 2025"
    },
    {
      "text": "Party: buyer Mira",
      "value": "buyer Mira"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tracking_number: EE482731695IN",
      "value": "EE482731695IN"
    },
    {
      "text": "Carrier: India Post",
      "value": "India Post"
    }
  ]
}
